<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-13T16:11:18.790Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:11:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have launched air strikes on gold mining sites along the Sudan-Egypt border, killing dozens of miners, while the Rapid Support Forces used a paramilitary drone to strike near the Ethiopian frontier, causing additional casualties. These attacks extend fighting into civilian mining areas and the border triangle region, threatening civilians in West Kordofan. The war has already produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/africa/egypt-sudan-goldmine-strike.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168577&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168556&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNdUNTTXZadFFkTDZQNEc0UzZjbUxYTkt2eXNkNGthZHdPTXZWNFJxVGJadUhyRXh3OWpHV1dDemwzeThXZk9BLVhjejI2MUtnblJDMlRnbzZ0bjhBQU9BSTFKQ1lwOWxTQk9tblFWMlk5dVZ5TlduWEs3TFdNbUVDd0ZjWUdRR3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1kSGVDUUVRNkpSVlpUcDZWY3UwQXJrRl9ockVsTGdvZVVQS1VFS1hZcVFhRjZ6QnFVMDlJcFZtUm1XMV9FeGdmMHo5b1M1VkVpdllmV25UbU1iM1lLOUdCcUNKOUIxYmotbWg5ZXBOMk1xQnI4SnNmLU5B?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
